---
// Interests.astro - "What drives me" (Figma: #9:288)
---

<div class="interests-section reveal-scroll">
  <div class="interests-header">
    <h2 class="interests-title">
      What drives me
      <svg class="doodle-loop" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M6 30 C 16 6, 32 6, 34 18 C 35 25, 24 32, 12 26" stroke="#C1F100" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="interests-grid">
    <article class="interest-card interest-card-1">
      <div class="icon-square">
        <svg width="16.31" height="26.13" viewBox="0 0 16.31 26.13" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M9.2 3.4L12.9 7.1 4.5 15.5l-3.2 2.6L2 14.9l7.2-11.5z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none" />
          <path d="M9.9 2.7L12.9 5.7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="M4.7 15.3c-1.6 2.4-2.8 6.4-3.3 9.8 3.4-.5 7.4-1.7 9.8-3.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="interest-title">Structural Harmony</h3>
      <p class="interest-desc">
        Finding the perfect balance between robust invisible grids and chaotic visible content.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="interest-card interest-card-2">
      <div class="icon-underline">
        <svg width="23.6" height="23.51" viewBox="0 0 23.6 23.51" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3 3.5c4.5 6.2 13 6.2 17.6 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" />
          <path d="M11.8 3.8v16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="M3.5 22h16.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="interest-title">Ink & Paper</h3>
      <p class="interest-desc">
        The analog world is my primary source of inspiration. Moleskines over monitors.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="interest-card interest-card-3">
      <div class="icon-dashed">
        <svg width="28.47" height="28.47" viewBox="0 0 28.47 28.47" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3.2 10.2h22.1c-1.4 9.2-7.1 14.3-11.05 14.3S4.6 19.4 3.2 10.2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none" />
          <path d="M1.8 24.7h24.9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="M14.2 3.5c0-1 .9-1.8 1.8-1.5 1.2.4 1.2 2.3 0 2.7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="interest-title">Caffeine & Code</h3>
      <p class="interest-desc">
        Fueling late-night debugging sessions and morning typography adjustments.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .interests-section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interests-section {
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
  }

  .interests-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interests-header {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
  }

  .interests-title {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interests-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  .doodle-loop {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    right: -20px;
    opacity: 0.5;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .doodle-loop {
      top: -16px;
      right: -32px;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }
  }

  .interests-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .interests-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .interests-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  .interest-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--primary);
    border-radius: 36px;
    padding: 20px 16px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interest-card {
      gap: 16px;
      border-radius: 135px 120px 120px 135px;
      padding: 30px 31px 32px;
    }
  }

  .interest-card-1 {
    background: var(--background);
  }

  .interest-card-2 {
    background: var(--surface-container-low);
  }

  .interest-card-3 {
    background: var(--background);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .interest-card-2 {
      padding-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .interest-card-3 {
      height: 280px;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  .icon-square,
  .icon-underline,
  .icon-dashed {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border: 1px solid var(--primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .icon-square,
    .icon-underline,
    .icon-dashed {
      width: 67.26px;
      height: 67.26px;
    }
  }

  .interest-card-2 .icon-underline {
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);
  }

  .interest-card-3 .icon-dashed {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--primary);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interest-card-3 .icon-dashed {
      width: 75.91px;
      height: 75.91px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
  }

  .interest-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interest-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 30px;
    }
  }

  .interest-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 20px;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    max-width: 302px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interest-desc {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
